{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--sakhalin-kusu-expresses-purpose-or-reason","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--overview"],"statement":{"en":"In Sakhalin Ainu, the conjunctive particle kusu expresses purpose, reason, or cause.","ja":"樺太アイヌ語において、接続助詞 kusu は目的や理由・原因を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:sakhalin"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"unstated","conditions":[]},"forms":["kusu"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0039-01","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0103-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--sakhalin-kusu-marks-continuation-and-state","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--dialect"],"statement":{"en":"In Sakhalin Ainu, kusu expresses continuation of an action and resulting state, corresponding to Hokkaido kor and wa rather than cause or purpose.","ja":"樺太アイヌ語において kusu は原因・目的ではなく、北海道方言の kor や wa に相当する動作の継続や結果の状態を表す。"},"type":"variation","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:sakhalin"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"unstated","conditions":[]},"forms":["kusu","kor","wa"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0341-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[{"kind":"contradicts","claim":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--sakhalin-kusu-expresses-purpose-or-reason","differs_in":"unresolved","note":"Nakagawa characterizes Sakhalin kusu as expressing continuation and resulting state (like Hokkaido kor and wa) rather than cause/purpose, whereas Murasaki describes it as expressing purpose, reason, o"}],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--examples-of-hi-kusu-are-very-few-outside","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--dialect"],"statement":{"en":"Examples of hi kusu are very few outside the Saru and Chitose dialects, indicating regional variation.","ja":"hi kusu は沙流・千歳方言以外では非常に用例が少なく、地域差があるようである。"},"type":"variation","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/saru","doculect:hokkaido/chitose"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["hi kusu"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0350-04","stance":"proposes"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--the-shizunai-dialect-has-three-consequential-conjunctionalizers-kusu","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--dialect"],"statement":{"en":"The Shizunai dialect has three consequential conjunctionalizers: kusu, kunine, and na.","ja":"静内方言には3つの結果接続詞、すなわち kusu、kunine、na がある。"},"type":"membership","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kusu","kunine","na"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0244-10","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--kusu-with-meanings-similar-to-shizunai-is-found","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--dialect"],"statement":{"en":"kusu with meanings similar to Shizunai is found both in the Saru dialect and in the Sakhalin Raychishka dialect.","ja":"静内方言と同様の意味を持つkusuは、沙流方言にも樺太来知志方言にも見られる。"},"type":"variation","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/saru","doculect:sakhalin/south"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kusu"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0246-03","stance":"reports"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--in-the-author-s-shizunai-material-kunine-appears","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--dialect"],"statement":{"en":"In the author's Shizunai material, kunine appears infrequently, whereas kusu is the generally used form.","ja":"著者の静内方言資料においてkunineの出現頻度は低く、一般的に用いられる形式はkusuである。"},"type":"frequency","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"usually","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kunine","kusu"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0246-06","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--kunine-with-the-same-meaning-is-also-found","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--dialect"],"statement":{"en":"Kunine with the same meaning is also found in the Saru and Raychishka dialects.","ja":"同様の意味を持つkunineは、沙流方言および来知志方言にも見られる。"},"type":"variation","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/saru","doculect:sakhalin/south"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kunine"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0246-09","stance":"reports"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--kusu-has-an-independent-free-usage-where-it","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--free-use"],"statement":{"en":"kusu has an independent (free) usage where it can stand sentence-initially meaning 'for that reason / therefore'.","ja":"kusu には自立用法があり、「そのために」という意味で文頭に立つことができる。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"possible","conditions":["sentence-initial"]},"forms":["kusu"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0350-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--the-element-kusu-forms-part-of-compounds-such","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--free-use"],"statement":{"en":"The element kusu forms part of compounds such as nepkus 'why', wakusu 'so that', and nekusu 'therefore'.","ja":"kusuという要素は、nepkus「なぜ」、wakusu「そのように」、nekusu「したがって」といった複合語の一部を成している。"},"type":"membership","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kusu","nepkus","wakusu","nekusu"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0246-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--kusu-is-used-as-a-conjunctive-particle-meaning","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--free-use"],"statement":{"en":"kusu is used as a conjunctive particle meaning 'because/since', but can also occur alone as an adverb meaning 'therefore' or 'for that reason'.","ja":"kusu は接続助詞として「ので」という理由を表すが，単独で副詞として用いられて「そのため」「それゆえ」の意味を表すこともある。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/chitose"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kusu"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0117-06","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--the-light-noun-kus-u-expresses-intentional-modality","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--overview"],"statement":{"en":"The light noun kus-u expresses intentional modality.","ja":"形式名詞kus-uは意図のモダリティを表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kus-u"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2016@pdftotext-pieces/l0006-08","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--the-conjunction-kusu-expresses-cause-or-reason-because","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--overview"],"statement":{"en":"The conjunction kusu expresses cause or reason ('because', 'since'), purpose ('in order to', 'intending to'), functions as an exclamatory particle, and expresses indirect command.","ja":"kusu は原因・理由（「……から」「……ので」）、目的（「……せんとして」「……するために」）、感嘆の助詞、および命令の間接叙法を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kusu"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0163-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--the-final-vowel-of-kusu-is-often-devoiced","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--overview"],"statement":{"en":"The final vowel of kusu is often devoiced, frequently resulting in the pronunciation kus.","ja":"kusu の最後の母音は無声化されて kus のように発音されることも多い。"},"type":"alternation","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"usually","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kusu","kus"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0349-08","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--in-the-author-s-analysis-kusu-is-defined","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--overview"],"statement":{"en":"In the author's analysis, kusu is defined as a conjunctionalizer.","ja":"著者の分析では、kusu は接続詞化辞（conjunctionalizer）として定義される。"},"type":"analysis","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kusu"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0018-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--kusu-functions-as-a-conjunctionalizer","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--overview"],"statement":{"en":"kusu functions as a conjunctionalizer.","ja":"kusu は接続化辞として機能する。"},"type":"analysis","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kusu"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0028-06","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--consequential-conjunctionalizers-indicate-that-the-conjunctionalized-clause-expresses","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--overview"],"statement":{"en":"Consequential conjunctionalizers indicate that the conjunctionalized clause expresses the cause or the purpose of the following clause.","ja":"結果接続詞は、接続された節が後続節の原因または目的であることを表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":[],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0244-09","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--in-rapid-speech-the-final-vowel-u-of","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--overview"],"statement":{"en":"In rapid speech, the final vowel [u] of kusu is often dropped.","ja":"早口の談話において、kusu の語尾母音 [u] はしばしば脱落する。"},"type":"alternation","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"usually","modality":"actual","conditions":["in rapid speech"]},"forms":["kusu"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0244-12","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--kusu-and-its-variant-kus-means-in-order","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--overview"],"statement":{"en":"'kusu' (and its variant 'kus') means 'in order to', 'because', or 'since'.","ja":"kusu, kus は「〜するために, 〜するから, 〜したから」を意味する。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kusu","kus"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0071-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--kus-is-a-phonologically-reduced-variant-of-the","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--overview"],"statement":{"en":"kus is a phonologically reduced variant of the conjunctive particle kusu 'because, in order to'.","ja":"kus は接続助詞 kusu「ので，のために」の弱まった形である。"},"type":"alternation","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/chitose"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kus","kusu"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0117-08","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--kus-is-a-reduced-variant-of-kusu-because","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--overview"],"statement":{"en":"kus is a reduced variant of kusu 'because'.","ja":"kus は kusu「〜ので」の縮約形である。"},"type":"alternation","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kus","kusu"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0387-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--kusu-is-a-subordinating-conjunction-meaning-because-or","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--overview"],"statement":{"en":"kusu is a subordinating conjunction meaning 'because' or 'in order to'.","ja":"kusu は「〜なので」「〜するために」を意味する従属接続詞である。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kusu"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:shibatani1990@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0020-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--speaker-intention-is-expressed-by-the-particle-kusu","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--overview"],"statement":{"en":"Speaker intention is expressed by the particle kusu, which also serves as a subordinating conjunctive meaning 'because' and 'in order to'.","ja":"話者の意図は助詞kusuによって表され、kusuは「〜だから」「〜するために」という意味の従属接続詞としても用いられる。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kusu","kusu-ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:shibatani1990@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0051-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--kusu-in-order-to-because-since-is-used","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--polysemy"],"statement":{"en":"kusu ('in order to / because / since') is used when the preceding clause indicates the purpose, cause, or reason for the following clause.","ja":"kusu 「〜するために」「〜するので」「〜したので」は、前の文が後ろの文の目的や原因、理由を示す時に用いる。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kusu"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0349-07","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--kusu-either-expresses-a-causal-relation-between-two","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--polysemy"],"statement":{"en":"Kusu either expresses a causal relation between two clauses or marks the preceding action, state, or event as the purpose of the action in the main clause.","ja":"kusu は2文間の原因関係を表すか、または接続された文の行為・状態・事象が主節述語の行為の目的であることを表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kusu"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0244-11","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--refsing-defines-kusu-as-a-conjunctionalizer-that-in","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--purpose"],"statement":{"en":"Refsing defines kusu as a conjunctionalizer that, in one of its functions, marks the conjunctionalized clause as the purpose of the subsequent clause.","ja":"レフシングは kusu を接続辞として定義し、その機能の一つとして、接続節が後続節の目的であることを表すとする。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kusu"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0030-11","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--kunine-conjoins-two-sentences-such-that-the-event","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--purpose"],"statement":{"en":"Kunine conjoins two sentences such that the event of the second sentence is performed with the purpose of bringing about the first (conjunctionalized) sentence.","ja":"kunineは、第二の文が第一の（接続助詞化された）文をもたらす目的で行われるように二つの文を接続する。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kunine"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0246-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--kunine-resembles-kusu-in-having-the-meaning-in","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--purpose"],"statement":{"en":"Kunine resembles kusu in having the meaning 'in order to / in order that'.","ja":"kunineは「〜するために」という意味においてkusuに類似している。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kunine","kusu"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0246-05","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--etymologically-kunine-is-probably-connected-with-the-quotationalizer","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--purpose"],"statement":{"en":"Etymologically, kunine is probably connected with the quotationalizer kuni and the copula ne.","ja":"語源的には、kunineはおそらく引用詞kuniおよびコピュラneと関連している。"},"type":"diachrony","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"possible","conditions":[]},"forms":["kunine","kuni","ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0246-07","stance":"proposes"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--the-conjunctionalizer-na-marks-a-clause-that-contains","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--reason"],"statement":{"en":"The conjunctionalizer na marks a clause that contains the justification or reason for a subsequent command or request.","ja":"接続助詞化詞naは、後続の命令や依頼の正当化または理由を含む文を接続する。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["na"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0246-10","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--the-expression-p-ne-kusu-expresses-reason-but","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--reason"],"statement":{"en":"The expression p ne kusu expresses reason, but typically conveys emotional nuances such as unexpectedness or admiration.","ja":"p ne kusu は理由を表す表現であるが、「意外」や「感嘆」のような感情的なニュアンスを含む。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["p ne kusu"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0176-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--the-expression-pe-ne-kusu-expresses-reason-or","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--reason"],"statement":{"en":"The expression pe ne kusu expresses reason or cause, but tends to convey an emotive nuance.","ja":"pe ne kusu は理由を表す形式であるが、感情的なニュアンスを含む表現のようである。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["pe ne kusu"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0350-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--s-kor-an-pe-kusu-expresses-the-meaning","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--reason"],"statement":{"en":"sēkor an pe kusu expresses the meaning 'for the reason that, because it is said that'.","ja":"sēkor an pe kusu は、「という理由で、ということなので」という意味を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["sēkor an pe kusu"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0365-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--kusu-functions-as-a-causal-conjunction-meaning-because","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--reason"],"statement":{"en":"kusu functions as a causal conjunction meaning 'because, since'.","ja":"kusu は「〜ので」を意味する原因・理由の接続助詞である。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kusu"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0387-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--wa-kusu-because-since-is-used-to-express","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--wa-kusu-hi-kusu"],"statement":{"en":"wa kusu ('because / since') is used to express reason or cause, and cannot be used to express purpose.","ja":"wa kusu 「〜したので」は、理由や原因を示す時に用い、目的を示すのには使えない。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"necessary","conditions":[]},"forms":["wa kusu"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0350-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--hi-kusu-because-since-is-used-to-express","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--wa-kusu-hi-kusu"],"statement":{"en":"hi kusu ('because / since') is used to express reason or cause, and cannot be used to express purpose.","ja":"hi kusu 「〜するので」「〜したので」は、理由や原因を示す時に用い、目的を示すのには使えない。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"necessary","conditions":[]},"forms":["hi kusu"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0350-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--when-wa-kusu-occurs-it-is-frequently-translated","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--wa-kusu-hi-kusu"],"statement":{"en":"When wa kusu occurs, it is frequently translated as 'because ...ed' or 'having ...ed, therefore'.","ja":"wa kusu となった場合，「たので」と訳されることが多い。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/chitose"],"quantifier":"usually","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["wa kusu"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0117-07","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--the-combination-wa-kusu-composed-of-wa-and","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses","topic:complex/causal-and-purpose-clauses--wa-kusu-hi-kusu"],"statement":{"en":"The combination wa kusu (composed of wa 'and/te' and kusu 'for that purpose') expresses the meaning 'because / since'.","ja":"wa「て」, kusu「そのために」で,「たので」という意味を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["wa kusu"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0357-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
